    "body": "The prerequisite #1864 is still open and has no open PR to stack on.\nUpstream/main 6f8b309d has no DXF or sketch modules. FeatureSel in crates/app/src/operation/types/sel.rs has Face, Chain, Patch, and Vertex, but no sketch-layer selection. The existing selection code still refuses open runs for Engrave and Trace.\n#1862 and #1863 are also open. #1862 owns the Sketch entity, ImportDxf command, persistence, and MCP import support needed by this issue.\nCompleting #1869 now would require implementing those prerequisite issues. This worker is restricted to #1869, so it stops without claiming or changing code. This is not an already-fixed finding.\nOverlap check: PRs #1817 and #1713 both change run_job_arms in crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs. Neither supplies the missing sketch support.\n",
